# nuka accept's own acceptance records for the nukadoko dogfood scenario:
# its steps' returned values legitimately include the mkdtemp scratch
# path each run creates, so any accepted record embeds a machine-local
# path and cannot be committed clean. report.md carries the durable,
# path-free record of a passing run instead.
features/*.md
